      "id": "b000019",
      "kind": "list",
      "start_line": 32,
      "end_line": 36,
      "raw": "- Automated C++ regression coverage now lives in `test/cpp/suites/*.cpp`, locking cron parsing,\n  minute-level deduplication, interval trigger progression, unix-time analysis, and scheduler hook state for\n  `WhatSonCronExpression`, `WhatSonUnixTimeAnalyzer`, and `WhatSonAsyncScheduler`.\n- `WhatSonAsyncScheduler::start()` now only reports success when the underlying `QTimer` actually becomes active; if\n  the current thread cannot host timers, the scheduler emits a warning and keeps `running` false.\n",
